       "The girl who can speak Chinese is pretty."
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "pattern": "Person + verb + 完 + thing 1 + 就 + thing 2",
     "meaning": "Do thing 2 straight after finishing thing 1.",
     "examples": [
      [
       "我们吃完饭就去玩儿。",
       "We'll go out as soon as we've eaten."
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "pattern": "Verb + 过",
     "meaning": "Have done something before (past experience). Negative: 没 + verb + 过.",
     "examples": [
      [
       "我看过这本书。",
       "I've read this book."
      ],
      [
       "我从来没听过他的歌。",
       "I've never heard his songs."
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "pattern": "过 vs 了",
     "meaning": "了 = an action is done. 过 = you have the experience of doing it.",
     "examples": [
      [
       "他去了法国。",
       "He went to France."
      ],
      [
       "他去过法国。",
       "He's been to France (before)."
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "pattern": "Person (verb) + 是 + verb + 过，可是……",
     "meaning": "I did do it before, but...",
